        "node_id": "n_6_66acc2",
        "thought_text": "Use a forward pass to propagate the maximum speed from the start ($v_1$) to each second, ensuring the change limit $d$ is respected, followed by a backward pass from the end ($v_2$) to refine the limits, finally summing the resulting array.",
